THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This lab integrates and references third-party tools, each under its own license.
They are not redistributed here except where a config file is committed for
reproducibility (noted below). Consult each project for full terms.

- Wazuh (manager/indexer/dashboard) — GPLv2 / Apache-2.0 components — https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh
- Sysmon (Sysinternals) — Microsoft Software License Terms — https://learn.microsoft.com/sysinternals/
- sysmon-modular config (lab/endpoint/sysmonconfig.xml, committed for reproducibility)
  — MIT, Olaf Hartong — https://github.com/olafhartong/sysmon-modular
- Atomic Red Team (Invoke-AtomicRedTeam, atomic tests) — MIT, Red Canary
  — https://github.com/redcanaryco/atomic-red-team
- Sigma (rule format + converters) — DRL-1.1 / per-tool — https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma
- MITRE ATT&CK (framework, technique IDs) — ATT&CK Terms of Use, © The MITRE Corporation
  — https://attack.mitre.org/resources/legal-and-branding/terms-of-use/
- Palantir ADS framework (detection documentation structure), MIT
  — https://github.com/palantir/alerting-detection-strategy-framework

Trademarks and technique identifiers are property of their respective owners.
